# Edge mode "cloudflare" (proxied record). PREPARED, NOT ACTIVATED: needs gate A2 option B.
# Client-address headers are honoured only when the TCP peer is inside the Cloudflare ranges below AND
# (see cloudflare.site.caddy) the TLS connection presented a client certificate from the origin-pull CA.
# The ranges file is NOT committed: generate it at A2 from Cloudflare's official lists with
#   node scripts/remote/cloudflare-ips.mjs > deploy/remote-mcp/edge/cloudflare-ips.caddy
# Without it Caddy refuses to start in this mode (fail closed).
import cloudflare-ips.caddy
client_ip_headers CF-Connecting-IP
trusted_proxies_strict
